#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid "You can modify the Weathermap Node from here.  The Position columns are the X,Y position on the Map.  The Internal Name is the unique ID given to the Node.  The Label is the external name of the Node that you provide to users.  The Icon Filename is the Graphic that you want to represent the Node Object.  The INFO URL is a link that you can provide when clicking on the active Map Node.  The Hover Graph URL's are Cacti or other Graphs URL's that can will appear when hovering over the Node.  The Graph Selector is a helper for selecting Cacti Graphs for the Graph URL's.   There are several other Node properties possible.  However, today we are only supporting those included above."
msgstr "Halkan waxaad wax uga beddeli kartaa Guntinta Weathermap. Tiirarka Meeshu waa goobta X,Y ee Khariidadda. Magaca Guduhu waa aqoonsiga gaarka ah ee la siiyo Guntinta. Calaamadda waa magaca dibadda ee Guntinta ee aad siiso isticmaalayaasha. Magaca Faylka Astaantu waa sawirka aad rabto inuu matalo Walaxda Guntinta. INFO URL waa xiriiriye aad bixin karto marka la gujiyo Guntinta Khariidadda firfircoon. URL-yada Jaantuska Dul-saarku waa URL-yo Jaantusyada Cacti ama kuwa kale oo muuqan doona marka la dul-saaro Guntinta. Xulaha Jaantusku waa caawiye lagu doorto Jaantusyada Cacti ee URL-yada Jaantuska. Waxaa jira sifooyin kale oo Guntin ah oo suurtagal ah. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, maanta waxaan taageernaa kuwa kor ku xusan oo keliya."

