#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Baaxadda gudbinta:</strong> Deji awoodda loo adeegsado xisaabinta isticmaalka, tusaale ahaan 100M ama 1G. K, M, G iyo T waa la taageeraa. Dooro La mid ah &quot;Soo gal&quot; marka labada jihoba ay leeyihiin awood isku mid ah.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Is-dhexgalka socodka xogta:</strong> Ku raadi qalab, port ama sharaxaad, ama dooro Baar dhammaan. Dooro is-dhexgal, ka dibna guji Isticmaal is-dhexgalka si aad u dejiso isha aasaasiga ah ee la cabbiray, meesha gujinta iyo jaantuska dul-saarka ee weyn. Ilaha dheeraadka ah ee la cabbiray iyo jaantusyada dul-saarka waa la hayaa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Muuqaalka iyo faallooyinka:</strong> Qaabka Marinku wuxuu maamulaa qaloocyada siman ama geesaha leh; Ballaca Xiriirku wuxuu maamulaa dhumucda fallaarta. Faallada SOO GAL iyo Faallada BAX waxay ku daraan qoraal jiho kasta. Boqolleyda ayaa dejisa meesha qoraalku kaga yaallo xiriirka. Qaabka Faalladu wuxuu dhigaa faallooyinka dhinaca xiriirka (Geeska) ama fallaarta dusheeda (Bartamaha); Isticmaal asalka khariidaddu wuxuu raacaa Qaabka Khariidadda.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Jaantusyada dul-saarka ee dheeraadka ah:</strong> Muuji ugu badnaan laba jaantus dul-saar ah: jaantuska weyn ee socodka xogta iyo hal dheeraad ah, sida CPU, daahitaan ama is-dhexgal kale. Ku shaandhee nooca jaantuska waxay soo koobtaa doorashooyinka. Ku dar jaantuska dul-saarka waxay ku dartaa midka dheeraadka ah; Beddel jaantusyada dul-saarka way beddeshaa; Ka saar jaantuska way ka saartaa. Jaantuska weyn ee socodka xogta, socodka xogta la cabbiray iyo meesha gujinta xiriirku isma beddelaan. Daawadaha, horu-eegid kasta oo Cacti ah waxay furtaa jaantuskeeda buuxa marka la gujiyo.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Dejinta sare:</strong> Kontaroollo ikhtiyaari ah oo lagu dhaqaajiyo calaamadaha socodka xogta SOO GAL/BAX, lagu mideeyo ilaha la cabbiray, lagu beddelo meesha gujinta laguna geliyo URL-yada sawirrada dul-saarka ee gaarka ah. Meelaha calaamadaha socodka xogta waxay dhaqaajiyaan sanduuqyada isticmaalka iyagoo ka madax-bannaan meelaha faallooyinka. Isticmaal asalka khariidaddu wuxuu raacaa Qaabka Khariidadda. Xiriirka caadiga ah ee socodka xogta badanaa uma baahna wax isbeddel ah halkan.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Isku-darka ilaha socodka xogta:</strong> Ku dar isha socodka xogta waxay ku dartaa is-dhexgal kale wadarta khariidadda, si gooni ah SOO GAL iyo BAX. Ka saar isha waxay ka saartaa il dheeraad ah. Ka beddel isha aasaasiga ah adigoo isticmaalaya Isticmaal is-dhexgalka ee kor ku yaalla. Socodka xogta ee la mideeyay waxaa lala barbardhigaa baaxadda gudbinta ee la habeeyay si loo xisaabiyo isticmaalka. Jaantus Cacti oo isku-dhafan si otomaatig ah looma abuuro; ka abuur jaantus isku-dar ah oo u dhigma gudaha Cacti oo geli URL-yadiisa gujinta iyo dul-saarka haddii loo baahdo. Xiriirrada khariidadda ee kala goonida ah badanaa way ka cad yihiin xiriirrada aasaasiga ah iyo kuwa kaydka ah.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ilaha iyo URL-yada gacanta ah:</strong> Sanduuqa qoraalka isha wuxuu tafatiraa liiska dhammaystiran ee ilaha la cabbiray, oo ay ku jirto isha aasaasiga ah. URL-ka meesha gujintu wuxuu maamulaa halka gujinta xiriirka khariidaddu geyso. URL-ka jaantuska dul-saarka ee weyn wuxuu dejiyaa horu-eegidda koowaad; URL(yada) jaantuska dheeraadka ah wuxuu aqbalaa hal URL sawir oo dheeraad ah. Kan dheeraadka ah waxaa sidoo kale lagu maamulaa Jaantusyada dul-saarka ee dheeraadka ah.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hagaaji iyo Marin:</strong> Hagaaji wuxuu hagaajiyaa qaabka xiriirka. Marin wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad barta qalooca dhigto khariidadda.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Wax ka beddel Habaynta Tooska ah:</strong> Wax ka beddel qoraalka habaynta khariidadda ee hoose dejimaha ka baxsan foomkan.</p>"

